<title>USA: MidAmerican Energy unit issues preferred.</title>
<headline>MidAmerican Energy unit issues preferred.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following trust preferred security issue from MidAmerican Energy Financing, a unit of MidAmerican Energy Holdings, was priced on Friday, according to lead manager Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>BORROWER MIDAMERICAN ENERGY FINANCING</p>
<p>AMOUNT 4 MLN $25   MATURITY 12/31/2045</p>
<p>TYPE QUIPS	   DIVIDEND 7.98 PCT</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A3    FIRST PAY 12/31</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-A  CALLABLE NON CALL FIVE</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1672</p>
</text>
